option.ADAPTIVE_QUALITY=Adaptive quality
option.ADAPTIVE_QUALITY.comment=Follow the Skycraft mod's quality controller: it measures this machine and scales shadows, reflections, light shafts, the air, waves and the far field to hold the frame rate, far detail first. Off: fixed counts.
option.QUALITY_FALLBACK=Counts without the mod
